---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftChangeWorkPackage
---
Construct a ChangeWorkPackage draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Build coordinated implementation packages covering procurement, stock, production, documentation, and field actions as applicable. Sequence changes to avoid incompatible mixed configurations and identify irreversible dispositions requiring separate authorization.
